518
01:11:11,571 --> 01:11:15,196
Estou pronto, padre.

519
01:11:31,696 --> 01:11:34,821
Estou pronto.

520
01:11:52,696 --> 01:11:55,029
Meu filho.

521
01:11:56,987 --> 01:11:59,612
Estou pronto, padre.

522
01:12:05,821 --> 01:12:07,529
Estou pronto, padre.

523
01:12:07,612 --> 01:12:11,362
Estou pronto! Estou pronto, padre.

524
01:12:26,904 --> 01:12:27,821
Garota?

525
01:12:28,279 --> 01:12:29,071
Garota.

526
01:12:30,821 --> 01:12:31,612
Budi!

527
01:12:35,946 --> 01:12:37,571
