569
01:15:26,987 --> 01:15:27,987
Budi!

570
01:15:30,654 --> 01:15:31,821
Garota, pare!

571
01:15:37,737 --> 01:15:38,404
Garota!

572
01:15:45,321 --> 01:15:46,321
Budi!

573
01:15:50,779 --> 01:15:51,487
Budi?

574
01:16:14,404 --> 01:16:15,571
