601
01:19:10,196 --> 01:19:13,154
Marta! Sair dessa!

602
01:19:27,404 --> 01:19:30,946
- Marta! 
- Desculpe.

603
01:19:35,946 --> 01:19:44,696
Use esta Bíblia. Para parar Gadis. 
Pare, Ayub.

604
01:19:45,029 --> 01:19:46,904
