645
01:29:09,737 --> 01:29:11,612
- Nara? 
- Alfie, me desculpe.

646
01:29:11,696 --> 01:29:13,321
Você não fez nada de errado.

647
01:29:14,737 --> 01:29:15,946
Marta, ela..

648
01:29:16,779 --> 01:29:19,029
